1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,636
Phil: Rita, Larry—see you at the party. I'm heading to Pittsburgh.

2
00:00:07,125 --> 00:00:13,125
Town [stage]: Rita and Larry heard him in the lobby. Both went to the Rialto. Neither saw him empty the envelope.

3
00:00:13,125 --> 00:00:17,750
Town [stage]: Phil lets the evening go by in bed alone.

4
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:22,167
Town [stage]: Tuesday, February 2. Six am in the Hearthside Hotel.

5
00:00:22,167 --> 00:00:28,667
Town [stage]: Phil rides the coach and steps off at Pittsburgh.
